 "category_zh": "地质奇观",
 "category_en": "Geological wonder",
 "intro_zh": "荔波樟江风景名胜区由大小七孔景区、水春河景区和樟江风光带组成。景区内以丰富多样的喀斯特地貌、秀丽奇特的樟江水景和繁盛茂密的原始森林、各类珍稀品种动植物为特色，集奇特的山水自然风光与当地布依族、水族、瑶族等民族特色于一身。2007年，荔波喀斯特成为“中国南方喀斯特”世界自然遗产的组成部分。",
 "intro_en": "Libo Zhangjiang Scenic Area consists of the Big and Small Qikong Scenic Area, Shuichun River Scenic Area and Zhangjiang Scenic Area. The scenic area is characterized by rich and diverse karst landforms, the beautiful and unique Zhangjiang River waterscape, prosperous and dense virgin forests, and various rare species of animals and plants. It combines the unique natural landscape of mountains and rivers with the characteristics of the local Buyi, Shui, Yao and other ethnic groups. In 2007, Libo Karst became part of the \"Southern China Karst\" World Natural Heritage.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
